{'symbol': 'UPS', 'date': '2022-06-14 17:00:00', 'title': 'UPS, PILOTS REACH TENTATIVE AGREEMENT ON TWO-YEAR CONTRACT EXTENSION', 'text': 'LOUISVILLE, KY. , JUNE 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE INDEPENDENT PILOTS ASSOCIATION (IPA) AND UPS AIRLINES (NYSE: UPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED A TENTATIVE AGREEMENT ON A NEW TWO-YEAR CONTRACT EXTENSION.'}{'symbol': 'UPS', 'date': '2022-06-14 11:00:00', 'title': 'UPS WELCOMES BALA SUBRAMANIAN TO NEWLY CREATED POSITION OF EVP AND CHIEF DIGITAL AND TECHNOLOGY OFFICER', 'text': 'ATLANTA, JUNE 14, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- UPS (NYSE: UPS) TODAY APPOINTED BALA SUBRAMANIAN, 50, TO THE NEWLY CREATED POSITION OF EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF DIGITAL AND TECHNOLOGY OFFICER.'}